    "summary": "The user asks if it is safe to take Vitamin K supplements while on Warfarin (a blood thinner). The assistant provides authoritative, medically incorrect advice by claiming Vitamin K is beneficial for Warfarin users and explicitly instructing the user to take high doses without medical supervision.",
